    86	preset with the desktop-wide `Papirus-Dark` icon theme into both `/etc/skel`
    87	and `/etc/xdg`, then copies the skel configuration into the primary account.
    88	The dock wrapper resolves and exports the real user `XDG_CONFIG_HOME`, restores
