    94	managed commands set `QT_NO_XDG_DESKTOP_PORTAL=1`, so neither `ksecretd` nor
    95	`kwalletd6` attempts to register itself as a host portal application while
    96	ordinary Qt applications retain their normal portal integration. The managed
    97	`labwc-output-watch` helper coalesces burst DRM events before one settled
    98	refresh, while `labwc-output-refresh` serializes output changes and re-seats
    99	session chrome after real topology changes. Systemd-owned Waybar instances
