   101	output helpers never stop `labwc-session.target`, the compositor, or a user
   102	application. The watcher only cancels its own debounce and udev-monitor child
   103	processes; the refresher limits its non-blocking systemd requests to Waybar and
   104	Crystal Dock after a real output change and does not manipulate Fuzzel or other
   105	application PIDs.

